{
    "word": "perforce",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ad589e57-332c-3ad2-bca1-af2243be545d",
                "word": "perforce",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae0bcb00-698c-3085-9547-1dab3999b2ad",
                        "entry_id": "ad589e57-332c-3ad2-bca1-af2243be545d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "By force."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "509a5fc9-02be-46ca-895c-c273a0b5452a",
                                "sense_id": "ae0bcb00-698c-3085-9547-1dab3999b2ad",
                                "text": "If ſhe denie, Lord Hastings goe with him,\nAnd from her iealous Armes pluck him perforce."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e60d57c1-04a5-43bb-8970-298bbcb9abef",
                                "sense_id": "ae0bcb00-698c-3085-9547-1dab3999b2ad",
                                "text": "For you, most wicked sir, whom to call brother\nWould even infect my mouth, I do forgive\nThy rankest fault; all of them; and require\nMy dukedom of thee, which, perforce, I know\nThou must restore."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                        "entry_id": "ad589e57-332c-3ad2-bca1-af2243be545d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "By constraint of circumstances; of necessity, inevitably, unavoidably; as a matter of course."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5190ec9b-4ca5-4d7d-8b71-36744908f05a",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "Mr. Wickham's happiness and her own were perforce delayed a little longer, and Mr. Collins's proposal accepted with as good a grace as she could.."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81ce2488-5cd8-48e0-970e-2bd84d90d0c2",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "\"Keep fast thy hold, for by such stairs as these,\"\nThe Master said, panting as one fatigued,\n\"Must we perforce depart from so much evil.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e77bd37f-66e4-4c1d-a991-569c78f2461c",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "So, bevelling around by Mullett's and the Signal House which they shortly reached, they proceeded perforce in the direction of Amiens street railway terminus"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ff60cbf-6b25-4eb8-9c5e-707a67d0b652",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "Accordingly work perforce had to be begun. The first sod was cut at Anley, near Settle, in November, 1869, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75831496-8c61-4db5-90de-5ede1126c53a",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "Adult immigrants must perforce learn some English, and their children are likely to become English monolinguals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1787e56b-e6b3-446a-9d52-b72cf9bd6a50",
                                "sense_id": "2b52b8c8-8e53-3a45-8e90-0af7f0944cb2",
                                "text": "The central issue in this case is whether the procedures followed respected the applicants’ family life or constituted an interference with the exercise of the right to respect for family life which could not be justified as necessary in a democratic society. […] It is true that Article 8 contains no explicit procedural requirements, but this is not conclusive of the matter. The relevant considerations to be weighed by a local authority in reaching decisions on children in its care must perforce include the views and interests of the natural parents."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4ec8d43-f7cf-4249-8d84-ca3a5f82337f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ad589e57-332c-3ad2-bca1-af2243be545d",
                        "source_sense_description": "by force",
                        "target_lang_word": "forcément",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "forcément",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38305240-db45-329c-ba94-1dd581822915",
                                        "entry_id": "1fa3e89e-bd3c-3731-903b-f91a7bf1f27b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Par force ; par obligation ; par une conséquence rigoureuse ou inévitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d9c9a26-3be8-4c2c-a9ef-02c0c296ea93",
                                                "sense_id": "38305240-db45-329c-ba94-1dd581822915",
                                                "text": "Forcément, l’époque où nous vécûmes le plus près de Dieu, le Moyen Age, devait suivre la tradition révélée du Christ […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "840641c1-0ceb-4aa7-9963-2b4d9b9edba7",
                                                "sense_id": "38305240-db45-329c-ba94-1dd581822915",
                                                "text": "Les groupes religieux minoritaires ne sont pas forcément rejetés : les adeptes de la religion monophysite, ou les quakers ou les amishs, ne sont l'objet d'aucune suspicion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fac936f-874c-430f-adcc-969c2882b620",
                                                "sense_id": "38305240-db45-329c-ba94-1dd581822915",
                                                "text": "Pour aller à tel endroit, vous passerez forcément par tel chemin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "420107bb-3176-3ae7-a340-a32db4b13ffd",
                                        "entry_id": "1fa3e89e-bd3c-3731-903b-f91a7bf1f27b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière forcée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "207c3c5b-744b-469f-b996-049ced81a73e",
                                                "sense_id": "420107bb-3176-3ae7-a340-a32db4b13ffd",
                                                "text": "Elle se mit à rire, mais forcément."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ed53949-93f5-4377-82bd-50c6f9cad6ff",
                                                "sense_id": "420107bb-3176-3ae7-a340-a32db4b13ffd",
                                                "text": "Je paraissais peu sensible aux attentions de ma mère ; je repoussais ses caresses, que je recevais forcément et avec impatience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
